The nums is a list of 3, 2, and 1.
The first is -2000000000.
The second is -2000000000.
The third is -2000000000.
For each value in nums.
If value is more than first, set third to second, set second to first, set first to value.
If value is less than first and value is more than second, set third to second, set second to value.
If value is less than second and value is more than third, set third to value.

If third is -2000000000, show first, otherwise show third.
